    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Each dragonmark channel is tied to a specific dragonmark, such as the Mark of Healing or the Mark of Making, and you can only attune to it if you possess that dragonmark.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Activation</strong> Interact (Cast a Spell);</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per day;</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Effect</strong> you can cast one of the dragonmark focus spells that you know at level 1.</p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> at least 4 gp of siberys shards</p>"
    },
